# Ultimate Spider-Man: "Whenever you attack, double the number of each kind of counter on each Spider and legendary creature you
# control" - each kind, not only +1/+1 counters (CR 701.10e). Bot1 casts him as the back face on turn 1, puts a +1/+1 counter on him with
# Camouflage on turn 5, and on turn 7 its own Homesickness taps him and puts a stun counter on him. Memnite attacks alone: he has 2 of
# each kind, +1/+1 and stun.

